+    // GymTracker patch: a numeric `expiresAt` (epoch ms) in the notification's
+    // data sets Android's timeoutAfter, so an unread reminder is withdrawn when
+    // the next one is due instead of stacking up while the app is closed.
+    content.body?.optLong("expiresAt", 0L)?.let { expiresAt ->
